    <string name="chat_settings">Chat settings</string>
    <string name="settings_intro_title">What does this screen do?</string>
    <string name="settings_intro_text">Twitch sends a system NOTICE message whenever the chat mode changes (slow mode, emote-only, …). The current mode is always shown in the banner above the chat input. Use the switches below to choose whether these notices should ALSO appear as messages in the chat. Switch ON = hide the notice in chat. Changes are saved automatically.</string>
